WEBVTT

00:00:05.514 --> 00:00:07.204
I'm home!

00:00:09.784 --> 00:00:12.084
Jeez, neither of them are home.

00:00:12.084 --> 00:00:14.814
Even after I said I was coming
home for the weekend.

00:00:19.494 --> 00:00:20.924
Are they back?

00:00:23.964 --> 00:00:26.434
Wh-Who the heck are you?!

00:00:32.344 --> 00:00:35.244
It's pretty awesome, invincible power!

00:00:35.644 --> 00:00:38.514
Boy, does it feel great

00:00:38.874 --> 00:00:41.644
Absolutely lovely! So we never lose!

00:00:42.084 --> 00:00:45.244
Come on, let's head for tomorrow!

00:00:47.184 --> 00:00:48.324
Zettai Karen Children

00:00:48.324 --> 00:00:49.454
Zettai Karen Children
Yeah!

00:00:49.454 --> 00:00:50.754
Zettai Karen Children
Absolutely!

00:00:50.754 --> 00:00:52.424
Zettai Karen Children

00:00:52.424 --> 00:00:53.454
Zettai Karen Children
Daring!

00:00:53.624 --> 00:00:56.894
It just takes a touch for me to know

00:00:56.894 --> 00:00:59.364
The limiter on my heart

00:01:00.104 --> 00:01:02.794
Has been released, and then you see

00:01:03.204 --> 00:01:06.404
Yes! Change the world!

00:01:06.644 --> 00:01:09.504
Trying again and again through hot battle!

00:01:09.814 --> 00:01:13.114
Reaching through what's real

00:01:13.114 --> 00:01:16.354
Absolutely lovely! So we never lose!

00:01:16.354 --> 00:01:19.284
The thrills just can't be beat!

00:01:20.424 --> 00:01:26.894
Courage begins to light the
darkness of the world

00:01:26.894 --> 00:01:32.834
It overflows with the miracles you gave

00:01:33.264 --> 00:01:37.674
If you can take pride in a smile

00:01:37.674 --> 00:01:39.664
That suits no one else

00:01:39.874 --> 00:01:44.414
Then let's go beyond the future now

00:01:44.414 --> 00:01:48.504
We can try over the future world!

00:01:48.744 --> 00:01:49.114
Yeah!

00:01:49.854 --> 00:01:50.504
Ultimate!

00:01:52.654 --> 00:01:53.884
Daring!

00:02:03.634 --> 00:02:06.604
Site, secured. Looks like a couple

00:02:06.604 --> 00:02:07.364
of overzealous fans of Akie and Yoshimi
Akashi tried to force their way in.

00:02:07.364 --> 00:02:09.574
13th sense.
"Family Breakdown! Operation Paradise!!"
of overzealous fans of Akie and Yoshimi
Akashi tried to force their way in.

00:02:09.574 --> 00:02:09.834
of overzealous fans of Akie and Yoshimi
Akashi tried to force their way in.

00:02:09.834 --> 00:02:11.164
Kaoru!

00:02:12.174 --> 00:02:13.034
Minamoto.

00:02:13.174 --> 00:02:15.644
What the hell happened?!

00:02:15.644 --> 00:02:18.814
Well, you know that essay
we were assigned to write?

00:02:18.814 --> 00:02:20.744
The one on "family"...

00:02:23.314 --> 00:02:25.684
Here's your homework assignment!

00:02:27.084 --> 00:02:31.144
Please write an essay. The theme will be "family."

00:02:32.294 --> 00:02:35.124
You'll be reading them in class
next week at this time.

00:02:37.394 --> 00:02:40.454
Bye-bye! Bye-bye!

00:02:42.474 --> 00:02:45.964
Say, Tono, would you like to
work on our essays together?

00:02:46.244 --> 00:02:48.804
Um, s-sure. That'd be okay.

00:02:50.014 --> 00:02:52.674
Perhaps you two will be
a family in the future!

00:02:54.214 --> 00:02:56.414
Wh-Wh-What are you saying?!

00:02:56.754 --> 00:03:00.414
Wh-Wh-Why would I have a family with her?!

00:03:08.924 --> 00:03:09.794
Finished!

00:03:09.794 --> 00:03:10.734
Me, too!

00:03:10.734 --> 00:03:12.224
Lemme see! Lemme copy it!

00:03:12.394 --> 00:03:14.464
Why would you want to copy it?

00:03:14.464 --> 00:03:16.804
It's meaningless unless you
write it yourself, right?

00:03:17.774 --> 00:03:19.474
What did you write about?

00:03:19.474 --> 00:03:21.964
Just about what my family's like.

00:03:22.344 --> 00:03:25.144
Well, with a few dramatic touches.

00:03:25.144 --> 00:03:27.744
We can't really write the whole truth, can we?

00:03:28.484 --> 00:03:30.274
A little lie to get by.

00:03:31.114 --> 00:03:33.214
A lie to get by...

00:03:34.484 --> 00:03:36.184
A lie...

00:03:38.054 --> 00:03:40.044
Eureka! I have it!

00:03:42.964 --> 00:03:47.054
When I grow up, I shall marry you, big brother!

00:03:47.164 --> 00:03:49.064
Oh, little sister!

00:03:49.064 --> 00:03:51.774
I await the day you are grown!

00:03:51.774 --> 00:03:55.134
"And Minamoto waited for her,
licking his lips in anticipation!"

00:03:56.074 --> 00:03:57.014
Ow!

00:03:57.014 --> 00:03:58.574
What are you writing?!

00:03:58.574 --> 00:04:00.914
An essay about "family."

00:04:01.344 --> 00:04:05.804
How is that an essay?! You want
to make me a social outcast?!

00:04:06.384 --> 00:04:09.044
I'm sorry, big brother.

00:04:09.394 --> 00:04:10.424
Who are you calling big brother?!

00:04:10.424 --> 00:04:11.724
Dear brother?
Who are you calling big brother?!

00:04:11.854 --> 00:04:15.884
That's not the problem here!
You have a family, don't you?!

00:04:17.194 --> 00:04:19.324
This is the legendary Star of the Nile.

00:04:19.734 --> 00:04:21.904
Popular actress Akie Akashi,

00:04:21.904 --> 00:04:24.974
taking time out from a dress rehearsal of
her new show "The Crimson Lizard"

00:04:24.974 --> 00:04:27.464
and a busy schedule of press
events and drama series.

00:04:47.324 --> 00:04:49.794
Money's everything in this world.

00:04:51.234 --> 00:04:53.834
Meanwhile, Akie's eldest daughter Yoshimi

00:04:53.834 --> 00:04:56.594
is quickly becoming a popular gravure idol.

00:04:57.104 --> 00:04:59.334
She now tries her hand at her first commercial!

00:05:11.884 --> 00:05:12.544
Fight!! KING COBRA ENERGY DRINK

00:05:13.254 --> 00:05:14.884
Deliciousness to bring you back to life!

00:05:14.884 --> 00:05:17.654
Relax! You can live, even when you're dead!

00:05:17.924 --> 00:05:19.364
They're huge...

00:05:19.364 --> 00:05:21.424
They both have such nice figures.

00:05:21.424 --> 00:05:23.224
Mom... Sis...

00:05:23.494 --> 00:05:27.394
Why not go home on the weekend?
You haven't been back for a while, have you?

00:05:28.264 --> 00:05:30.504
My home is here!

00:05:30.504 --> 00:05:31.934
Kaoru...

00:05:31.934 --> 00:05:36.134
Okay, fine! I just have to go home, right?

00:05:36.774 --> 00:05:40.114
So, after I'm forced to go home,
neither of them was there

00:05:40.114 --> 00:05:42.204
and some fanboys tried to force their way in!

00:05:42.484 --> 00:05:45.074
You went a little overboard
keeping them out, didn't you?

00:05:45.254 --> 00:05:49.154
There are some real jerks who sell
the home addresses of actresses!

00:05:49.354 --> 00:05:52.984
Then call the police or us before
you try to take them out!

00:05:53.764 --> 00:05:55.224
This way.

00:05:55.364 --> 00:05:57.194
Thank you.

00:05:58.094 --> 00:05:58.724
YOSHIMI AKASHI

00:05:59.734 --> 00:06:02.564
Yoshimi! What are you doing here,
dressed like that?!

00:06:02.564 --> 00:06:04.004
Huh?

00:06:04.004 --> 00:06:07.234
I ran straight over here from a
gravure shoot at the studio!

00:06:08.244 --> 00:06:11.474
Thanks for always putting up with
my little sister, Mr. Minamoto!

00:06:11.474 --> 00:06:14.044
Um, actually... How do I put this?

00:06:14.044 --> 00:06:15.314
Calm down.

00:06:15.314 --> 00:06:16.414
Oh!

00:06:16.414 --> 00:06:18.884
Actually, it was the other
people at fault this time.

00:06:18.884 --> 00:06:20.484
Don't worry about it!

00:06:20.484 --> 00:06:24.154
Anyway, just go back to the studio
and get back to work, okay?

00:06:25.624 --> 00:06:29.094
It's all right. I came because
I was done with the shoot.

00:06:29.094 --> 00:06:30.624
Then get changed!

00:06:30.794 --> 00:06:34.234
Sis, you used me as an excuse to come
and meet Minamoto, didn't you?!

00:06:34.234 --> 00:06:37.264
What's wrong with a girl who's ready
to marry trying to get a guy?!

00:06:37.804 --> 00:06:39.944
Minamoto's one of the elite!

00:06:39.944 --> 00:06:43.744
You can't find a guy like him on group dates!

00:06:45.544 --> 00:06:47.534
And what "group dates" would those be?!

00:06:50.714 --> 00:06:51.844
AKIE AKASHI

00:06:52.784 --> 00:06:54.184
Mom!

00:06:54.184 --> 00:06:56.254
It's because you only do things like that

00:06:56.254 --> 00:06:59.744
you can't move up from just doing gravure!

00:07:00.094 --> 00:07:02.464
Mom, what on Earth are you wearing?

00:07:02.694 --> 00:07:06.224
I ran straight over from the stage of
"The Crimson Lizard", I was so worried!

00:07:09.774 --> 00:07:13.574
You didn't come here because you
were worried about me at all.

00:07:13.844 --> 00:07:18.034
Thanks for always putting up with
my daughter, Mr. Minamoto.

00:07:19.044 --> 00:07:22.244
Yes. I have stolen away your precious gem.

00:07:22.244 --> 00:07:26.154
But in my heart, you are the
thief and I am the detective.

00:07:26.154 --> 00:07:28.554
Oh, hello, Chief...

00:07:28.554 --> 00:07:32.754
Because it is you who have stolen my heart!

00:07:32.924 --> 00:07:35.194
The chief is still doing the
postprocessing on this case!

00:07:35.364 --> 00:07:38.694
No! But, it's the actress, Akie Akashi!

00:07:38.694 --> 00:07:39.164
Chief!

00:07:39.164 --> 00:07:40.834
Please! I'm a fan!
Chief!

00:07:40.834 --> 00:07:42.364
Please, Young Mr. Kobayashi!

00:07:42.364 --> 00:07:42.904
Who are you talking about?!

00:07:42.904 --> 00:07:44.704
Young Mr. Oboro!
Who are you talking about?!

00:07:44.704 --> 00:07:46.534
You're not making sense!

00:07:48.174 --> 00:07:49.234
Excuse us.

00:07:49.744 --> 00:07:53.974
You stayed in costume, but you went
natural with the makeup, huh, Mom?

00:07:54.544 --> 00:07:56.484
What about it?

00:07:57.614 --> 00:08:01.824
Not only do you go after every young male
actor out there, but Minamoto, too?!

00:08:01.824 --> 00:08:04.844
It's been 5 years since your father
left! I need a husband, too!

00:08:09.494 --> 00:08:11.564
Um, excuse me? Let me go.
Don't you want a new daddy, Kaoru?

00:08:11.564 --> 00:08:12.904
Um, excuse me? Let me go.
No, you want a brother, right?

00:08:12.904 --> 00:08:15.524
Minamoto's being defiled.

00:08:16.174 --> 00:08:18.504
Sorry I'm late!

00:08:19.204 --> 00:08:20.674
This is a secret mission.

00:08:23.214 --> 00:08:25.574
We're helping the Akashi family to move!

00:08:25.574 --> 00:08:28.844
Do it secretly, so that nobody finds out about it!

00:08:30.484 --> 00:08:34.644
We will be helpful to Ms. Akie!

00:08:35.784 --> 00:08:37.484
AKAI MOVING CENTER

00:08:38.654 --> 00:08:41.384
That's what's got you so grumpy, Kaoru?

00:08:41.924 --> 00:08:45.034
Even Mr. Minamoto isn't made of stone.

00:08:45.034 --> 00:08:48.634
If those two tempt him, he's going to fold.

00:08:48.634 --> 00:08:49.634
What's that mean?

00:08:49.634 --> 00:08:51.604
Shut up! Enough, already!

00:08:51.904 --> 00:08:54.774
I think they're both pretty hot, though.

00:08:54.774 --> 00:08:57.274
Sis is 21 and lively,

00:08:57.274 --> 00:09:01.614
and Mom's a devilish woman who doesn't
look like she's ever had any kids.

00:09:04.284 --> 00:09:06.554
On days we took baths together,

00:09:06.554 --> 00:09:10.814
everywhere I'd look, I was thinking "Wow!"

00:09:10.954 --> 00:09:12.864
Like I should be paying for it!

00:09:12.864 --> 00:09:14.584
So, why are you criticizing me?

00:09:16.394 --> 00:09:20.264
I dunno. Maybe it bugs me that
you reacted so normally to it.

00:09:20.664 --> 00:09:22.934
Oh, now we know something.

00:09:22.934 --> 00:09:25.964
Apparently, even he's just a normal man.

00:09:26.244 --> 00:09:28.374
Quit making stuff up!

00:09:28.374 --> 00:09:31.774
Quit worrying. They were just teasing me!

00:09:32.014 --> 00:09:34.344
What I'd expect from Kaoru's family!

00:09:34.914 --> 00:09:36.544
I wonder.

00:09:37.514 --> 00:09:41.184
Anyway, don't do what you did again!

00:09:41.724 --> 00:09:42.924
But, that was-

00:09:42.924 --> 00:09:45.494
I know you had a reason.

00:09:45.494 --> 00:09:50.084
But using your powers to solve
every problem is going too far.

00:09:55.364 --> 00:09:57.464
Still, you have a nice family.

00:09:59.434 --> 00:10:02.704
They didn't blame you or scold
you for what you did.

00:10:04.144 --> 00:10:06.614
He just doesn't get it.

00:10:06.614 --> 00:10:09.204
Not scolding me means they just...

00:10:11.314 --> 00:10:13.954
Wow, it's a mansion!

00:10:13.954 --> 00:10:15.924
How many rooms does it have?

00:10:17.254 --> 00:10:19.124
Be careful moving those.

00:10:19.124 --> 00:10:20.824
Yes, Master.

00:10:20.824 --> 00:10:22.724
Leave this to us, Master.

00:10:23.134 --> 00:10:26.934
Good girls. You're such a help!

00:10:26.934 --> 00:10:27.664
Yes, Master!

00:10:29.264 --> 00:10:32.504
It's such a help to have you all helping out.

00:10:32.504 --> 00:10:34.804
This is easy for us.

00:10:35.744 --> 00:10:38.944
Oh? This box doesn't have anything written on it.

00:10:38.944 --> 00:10:41.244
Lemme see. I've got this.

00:10:42.384 --> 00:10:45.744
Stringy... Sheer... Shells?

00:10:45.884 --> 00:10:48.424
Wow, this is all amazing!
Is it the older sister's?

00:10:48.424 --> 00:10:50.894
Or maybe it's Kaoru's collection!

00:10:50.994 --> 00:10:54.054
Oh, put that box in my room, please.

00:10:54.664 --> 00:10:55.994
Right.
Right.

00:10:56.464 --> 00:10:58.434
The chest goes upstairs, right?

00:11:00.434 --> 00:11:04.334
For Pete's sake, helping them move...

00:11:04.634 --> 00:11:06.464
This goes in the older sister's room, right?

00:11:09.304 --> 00:11:11.304
Where's your room?

00:11:11.674 --> 00:11:15.134
My room isn't here! It's at Minamoto's place!

00:11:16.354 --> 00:11:17.944
I see. Sorry.

00:11:19.984 --> 00:11:23.694
People with psychic powers have it tough.

00:11:23.694 --> 00:11:25.924
But don't let it get you down.

00:11:25.924 --> 00:11:30.634
One day, someone will appear who
will understand you completely.

00:11:30.634 --> 00:11:31.834
Completely?

00:11:31.834 --> 00:11:35.324
Indeed! Like the deep love that
binds Naomi and I together

00:11:35.404 --> 00:11:39.134
harder, stronger, and hotter than
even the bonds of family!

00:11:42.044 --> 00:11:43.514
Heavy!

00:11:43.514 --> 00:11:45.474
Excuse me, Supervisor Tanizaki.
My hand must have slipped.

00:11:45.474 --> 00:11:46.964
Heavy...
Excuse me, Supervisor Tanizaki.
My hand must have slipped.

00:11:47.344 --> 00:11:49.244
It's okay...

00:11:52.384 --> 00:11:54.154
Found you.

00:11:54.154 --> 00:11:57.054
No matter where you go, you can't escape me.

00:12:00.724 --> 00:12:02.884
I have my reasons. Problem?

00:12:05.564 --> 00:12:07.894
I'll have it all.

00:12:08.204 --> 00:12:10.464
Whew! The move's all done.

00:12:10.874 --> 00:12:12.334
We getting some post-move soba to eat?

00:12:12.474 --> 00:12:16.774
Yeah, why don't we go out
for something good to eat?

00:12:16.774 --> 00:12:19.244
Leave it to the big star!

00:12:19.244 --> 00:12:21.314
Mom, Sis, since we're all together

00:12:21.314 --> 00:12:23.904
as a family for once, why don't we three-

00:12:24.414 --> 00:12:26.554
What do you like, Mr. Minamoto?

00:12:26.554 --> 00:12:27.224
Um, anything's fine with me...

00:12:27.224 --> 00:12:28.684
You can eat me up, if you want.
Um, anything's fine with me...

00:12:28.684 --> 00:12:30.054
You can eat me up, if you want.

00:12:30.054 --> 00:12:31.094
Say-

00:12:31.094 --> 00:12:33.964
Why don't we get a hotel suite
now and all stay there?

00:12:33.964 --> 00:12:35.224
A suite?

00:12:35.224 --> 00:12:37.824
We can have room service bring us dinner!

00:12:38.094 --> 00:12:41.264
Why don't we get a room with
a jacuzzi and have a bath?

00:12:41.264 --> 00:12:42.664
A bath?

00:12:42.664 --> 00:12:45.704
Um, if you're gonna do that, I'd better go.

00:12:45.704 --> 00:12:48.264
Mr. Minamoto could join us if
we wear swim suits, right?

00:12:49.444 --> 00:12:51.634
It'll be so much fun!

00:12:54.544 --> 00:12:57.574
PSYCHIC DOMESTIC VIOLENCE!

00:13:00.084 --> 00:13:01.524
Kaoru!

00:13:01.524 --> 00:13:05.044
Mom, Sis... Cut it out!

00:13:05.454 --> 00:13:06.694
Kaoru...

00:13:06.694 --> 00:13:10.234
Why don't you stop using Minamoto as
an excuse and just tell the truth?!

00:13:10.234 --> 00:13:12.994
You wanting to go out to eat and
stay at a hotel with everyone...

00:13:12.994 --> 00:13:15.834
You keep saying that, but all it really means...

00:13:15.834 --> 00:13:18.324
is that you don't want to be
in this house with me!

00:13:19.504 --> 00:13:22.674
You always do this! Even when
I come home occasionally,

00:13:22.674 --> 00:13:26.484
you're busy with work or a group
date and the house is empty!

00:13:26.484 --> 00:13:28.484
If you hate being with me that much,

00:13:28.484 --> 00:13:30.644
just come out and say it already!

00:13:32.514 --> 00:13:33.784
Kaoru...
Kaoru...

00:13:34.654 --> 00:13:36.224
You're so scared of my powers

00:13:36.224 --> 00:13:39.254
that you can't scold me, no
matter what I do, can you?!

00:13:39.254 --> 00:13:41.154
That's not family!

00:13:46.164 --> 00:13:48.324
That's over the line, you idiot.

00:13:49.064 --> 00:13:51.624
Minamoto... You're an idiot, too.

00:13:54.104 --> 00:13:55.594
Kaoru!
Kaoru!

00:13:57.214 --> 00:13:59.744
Aoi, Shiho, we have to go after her!

00:13:59.744 --> 00:14:01.614
Mr. Minamoto...

00:14:01.614 --> 00:14:04.314
Take good care of her, please.

00:14:04.314 --> 00:14:05.854
Ma'am?

00:14:05.854 --> 00:14:08.224
You see, don't you? We may be family,

00:14:08.224 --> 00:14:10.784
but we can't handle a real fight with her.

00:14:10.994 --> 00:14:12.624
You can't!

00:14:12.624 --> 00:14:15.524
I understand, but it isn't that simple.

00:14:16.664 --> 00:14:18.154
Let's go!

00:14:23.634 --> 00:14:25.104
Faster! Faster!

00:14:26.604 --> 00:14:29.974
We already received word that
the move's finished, sir.

00:14:29.974 --> 00:14:34.084
It's not that. If we show her that
we're sincerely coming to help,

00:14:34.084 --> 00:14:37.274
that'll get me in Ms. Akie's
good graces, won't it?

00:14:37.954 --> 00:14:40.944
By the way, why is Sakaki
coming along with us?

00:14:41.124 --> 00:14:43.884
Deliciousness that brings you back to life!
You can live, even when you're dead!

00:14:43.954 --> 00:14:45.284
You, too?!

00:14:48.994 --> 00:14:52.594
Kaoru, your powers are just too strong.

00:14:53.304 --> 00:14:56.104
For the other childrens' safety, you can't go.

00:14:56.104 --> 00:14:59.604
Other children..? But, what about me?

00:14:59.604 --> 00:15:01.934
Don't I matter?

00:15:02.974 --> 00:15:04.004
Stupid.

00:15:14.654 --> 00:15:16.384
Nice view, isn't it?

00:15:16.754 --> 00:15:18.414
Mr. Hyobu?!

00:15:19.254 --> 00:15:21.724
We're very much alike, you and I.

00:15:21.724 --> 00:15:24.364
No place where we really belong.

00:15:24.364 --> 00:15:27.394
Only an esper can understand
what it's like to be an esper.

00:15:27.804 --> 00:15:30.634
Not even parents and siblings can.

00:15:32.974 --> 00:15:35.274
I'm always watching over you.

00:15:35.274 --> 00:15:36.764
'Cuz he's a lolicon.

00:15:37.114 --> 00:15:38.674
R-Really?

00:15:38.674 --> 00:15:40.514
Don't say stuff that she'll misinterpret!

00:15:40.514 --> 00:15:43.384
What's to misinterpret? You're a total perv!

00:15:44.184 --> 00:15:46.174
OW! Leggo!

00:15:46.254 --> 00:15:48.054
Kaoru! Get away from him!

00:15:48.524 --> 00:15:49.454
Minamoto!

00:15:49.454 --> 00:15:50.284
Kaoru!

00:15:50.554 --> 00:15:53.154
Hello, my dear Minamoto. You're looking well.

00:15:53.664 --> 00:15:55.684
Shut up, criminal!

00:15:56.194 --> 00:15:59.164
With that, I think I'll take my leave for today.

00:15:59.164 --> 00:16:03.224
However, if you should find yourself
with no place to go...

00:16:05.034 --> 00:16:07.144
We can treat you like a little sister.

00:16:07.144 --> 00:16:08.694
Don't listen to him, Kaoru!

00:16:09.474 --> 00:16:11.004
A water pistol, again?!

00:16:11.944 --> 00:16:14.174
You are so unoriginal!

00:16:14.614 --> 00:16:18.444
Don't forget, I'm always ready to welcome you.

00:16:18.884 --> 00:16:21.614
And I'm more fun to live with
than the kid down there.

00:16:25.854 --> 00:16:28.694
Let's go back, Kaoru. Everyone's...

00:16:28.694 --> 00:16:31.464
Your mom and sister are worried, too.

00:16:31.464 --> 00:16:33.524
Who'd want to go back to their house?

00:16:33.804 --> 00:16:35.234
Kaoru...

00:16:36.804 --> 00:16:38.324
Yes? Huh?!

00:16:38.704 --> 00:16:41.034
We can't find Akie or Yoshimi anywhere!

00:16:41.174 --> 00:16:43.304
Dammit, where's my Yoshimi?!

00:16:43.414 --> 00:16:45.504
Where's my real, in-the-flesh Yoshimi gone?!

00:16:45.944 --> 00:16:47.944
According to Dr. Sakaki's psychometry,

00:16:47.944 --> 00:16:50.284
they were definitely taken by several men.

00:16:50.284 --> 00:16:51.944
Young Mr. Kobayashi, move out!

00:16:52.414 --> 00:16:53.814
Mom and Sis?!

00:16:54.284 --> 00:16:55.274
Let's go, Kaoru!

00:16:57.324 --> 00:17:01.564
Black minivan... Coast... Warehouse...

00:17:01.564 --> 00:17:03.424
Check for any warehouses on the coast!

00:17:03.964 --> 00:17:05.324
Satellite imagery, coming up.

00:17:09.334 --> 00:17:12.164
Found it. Sending coordinates.

00:17:14.444 --> 00:17:16.464
The Children have arrived in
the airspace over the site.

00:17:18.374 --> 00:17:20.114
Send them in!

00:17:20.114 --> 00:17:22.144
The Children, released!

00:17:22.144 --> 00:17:22.704
<<RELEASED>>
The Children, released!

00:17:25.314 --> 00:17:26.974
LET'S GO!

00:17:30.754 --> 00:17:34.714
Going after my family is a little over the line!

00:17:35.964 --> 00:17:38.824
Beautiful, sexy, and absolutely lovely! That's us!

00:17:40.034 --> 00:17:42.024
We'll send you to paradise!

00:17:42.604 --> 00:17:45.534
Special espers, The Children, have arrived!

00:17:50.474 --> 00:17:51.744
Kaoru?
Kaoru?

00:17:51.744 --> 00:17:53.044
Mom? Sis?

00:17:53.214 --> 00:17:56.084
You, in the glasses! Look over here!

00:17:56.084 --> 00:17:57.874
Who, me?

00:17:58.214 --> 00:18:00.914
I like that quiet-looking one!

00:18:01.224 --> 00:18:02.714
Me?

00:18:03.124 --> 00:18:04.254
What? It's a photo shoot?

00:18:04.254 --> 00:18:05.724
Hey pops, move!
What? It's a photo shoot?

00:18:05.724 --> 00:18:06.894
Pops?

00:18:06.894 --> 00:18:08.984
The lively-looking one isn't bad, either.

00:18:11.264 --> 00:18:13.534
Wait! What are you doing?!

00:18:13.534 --> 00:18:15.864
Even if they did take us against our will...

00:18:15.864 --> 00:18:17.474
...you have to value the fans!

00:18:17.474 --> 00:18:18.594
You're nuts!

00:18:20.074 --> 00:18:21.434
Miss!

00:18:22.474 --> 00:18:23.904
Please shake my hand!
Please shake my hand!

00:18:32.084 --> 00:18:34.854
An esper with tracking powers.

00:18:34.854 --> 00:18:38.624
He finds out where celebrities live,
sells that to the fans

00:18:38.624 --> 00:18:41.114
and then they force them to do photo shoots!

00:18:42.794 --> 00:18:45.364
I get it. So, the big man's here, too?

00:18:45.364 --> 00:18:46.864
Where is he now?

00:18:46.864 --> 00:18:47.664
There!

00:18:47.664 --> 00:18:48.654
Gulp!

00:18:49.204 --> 00:18:51.204
You're the ringleader?!

00:18:51.204 --> 00:18:53.834
If you want to catch me, just try it!

00:18:55.604 --> 00:18:57.944
How dare you do this to my family!

00:18:57.944 --> 00:19:00.604
I'll make you regret it with all your might!

00:19:08.554 --> 00:19:09.824
Kaoru, wait!

00:19:09.824 --> 00:19:10.824
Kaoru!

00:19:10.824 --> 00:19:12.624
Kaoru, cut it out!

00:19:15.894 --> 00:19:18.384
I... I'm sorry...

00:19:19.834 --> 00:19:21.494
SHUDDER

00:19:24.134 --> 00:19:26.074
Is Ms. Akie all right?!
Is Yoshimi all right?!

00:19:26.074 --> 00:19:28.504
Secure everyone! Confiscate all film!

00:19:28.504 --> 00:19:30.244
Wipe all data!

00:19:30.244 --> 00:19:33.074
I want binding confidentiality agreements
read, signed, and sealed!

00:19:33.074 --> 00:19:34.804
Read them the riot act!

00:19:35.284 --> 00:19:37.114
Everyone!

00:19:38.084 --> 00:19:41.524
We'd really appreciate it if you
helped us out with this.

00:19:41.524 --> 00:19:45.714
We like to cherish our family time.
You understand, right?

00:19:45.824 --> 00:19:46.154
Okay!

00:19:46.154 --> 00:19:47.644
OKAY!
Okay!

00:19:53.134 --> 00:19:54.964
Thank you, Kaoru.

00:19:55.434 --> 00:19:57.174
We were saved, thanks to you.

00:19:57.174 --> 00:19:59.294
You're amazing, like you always are.

00:19:59.474 --> 00:20:02.034
Look... I'm sorry about what I said before.

00:20:02.144 --> 00:20:04.144
No, it's all right.

00:20:04.144 --> 00:20:06.444
I'm sorry that you can't live with us usually.

00:20:06.884 --> 00:20:10.214
And what happened before, I thought
I'd be home sooner, but...

00:20:10.214 --> 00:20:13.654
No, I'm fine. It's all right. Don't worry about it.

00:20:14.584 --> 00:20:17.954
Minamoto! Let's all go home.

00:20:17.954 --> 00:20:19.484
Kaoru...
Kaoru...

00:20:20.324 --> 00:20:22.124
Kaoru.

00:20:22.124 --> 00:20:24.664
You have psychic powers.

00:20:24.664 --> 00:20:27.234
And they're the most powerful in the world.

00:20:27.234 --> 00:20:31.064
Anybody would be scared of them. Even me.

00:20:31.404 --> 00:20:32.774
Minamoto...

00:20:32.774 --> 00:20:35.674
But do you think I hate you?

00:20:36.274 --> 00:20:37.474
Uh-uh.

00:20:37.474 --> 00:20:39.244
That's all there is to it.

00:20:39.244 --> 00:20:43.374
When you're a little more grown-up,
that'll all pass, won't it?

00:20:43.884 --> 00:20:46.144
Try to understand the
weaknesses of regular people.

00:20:46.924 --> 00:20:49.484
The weaknesses of regular people...

00:20:51.054 --> 00:20:54.494
Minamoto... I'm spending the night with them.

00:20:56.064 --> 00:20:57.294
Kaoru...

00:20:57.294 --> 00:21:02.864
Family relationships... The special bond
you have with your mother and sister...

00:21:02.864 --> 00:21:05.494
can't be broken by any psychic power.

00:21:05.874 --> 00:21:09.144
Hey, let's all take a bath
together when we go home.

00:21:09.144 --> 00:21:10.944
Sure. Of course.

00:21:10.944 --> 00:21:14.504
Wow, I feel like I should
be paying money for that.

00:21:17.454 --> 00:21:20.824
"My mom and sister and I
have all kinds of problems,

00:21:20.824 --> 00:21:21.354
THEME: "FAMILY"
"My mom and sister and I
have all kinds of problems,

00:21:21.354 --> 00:21:24.424
THEME: "FAMILY"
"but I think we'll be able to overcome them."

00:21:24.424 --> 00:21:25.594
THEME: "FAMILY"
"Because they're my family,
and they're important to me."

00:21:25.594 --> 00:21:27.994
"Because they're my family,
and they're important to me."

00:21:27.994 --> 00:21:30.594
"I also have another family."

00:21:30.594 --> 00:21:34.364
"We fight sometimes, but they're
important to me, too."

00:21:34.364 --> 00:21:37.594
"We also have a 20-year-old
guy named Minamoto."

00:21:38.574 --> 00:21:40.404
"As for Minamoto..."

00:21:40.404 --> 00:21:44.904
When you're a little more grown-up,
that'll all pass, won't it?

00:21:45.344 --> 00:21:50.044
"As for Minamoto, he licks his lips
and eagerly awaits the day...

00:21:50.114 --> 00:21:55.724
"when I'm grown up and as lively and
big-boobed as my mom and sister!"

00:21:55.724 --> 00:21:59.854
I hope somebody somewhere
reports this Minamoto guy.

00:22:03.094 --> 00:22:05.754
Is somebody spreading rumors about me?

00:22:19.444 --> 00:22:24.574
There's no point in hiding it

00:22:24.884 --> 00:22:28.944
I know everything

00:22:29.684 --> 00:22:35.124
It's no mystery, because

00:22:35.494 --> 00:22:40.894
I love you

00:22:41.134 --> 00:22:45.534
Go on, look at me

00:22:45.804 --> 00:22:50.104
Truly, the bond of love we share

00:22:50.104 --> 00:22:52.074
Is absolute!

00:22:52.314 --> 00:22:57.014
An eternal, unchanging

00:22:57.014 --> 00:23:03.654
Absolute declaration to the world
I'll shout from Everest!

00:23:03.654 --> 00:23:08.494
I've accepted it

00:23:08.494 --> 00:23:12.894
The bond of love we share

00:23:12.894 --> 00:23:15.104
Is absolute!

00:23:15.104 --> 00:23:19.534
My wish, when fortune smiles on me

00:23:19.834 --> 00:23:23.944
In San Pietro, I'll swear it to you

00:23:23.944 --> 00:23:26.744
An absolute declaration of love!

00:23:39.924 --> 00:23:41.094
NEXT EPISODE

00:23:41.094 --> 00:23:42.894
NEXT EPISODE
Next time, on Zettai Karen Children!

00:23:43.424 --> 00:23:46.034
You're making Shiho do this?!

00:23:46.034 --> 00:23:48.204
If they have the power to solve this case,

00:23:48.204 --> 00:23:50.874
then it is their duty as a citizen and as an esper!

00:23:50.874 --> 00:23:52.074
Isn't that right, Shiho?

00:23:52.074 --> 00:23:52.904
Yes, Daddy.

00:23:52.904 --> 00:23:54.444
D-Daddy?!

00:23:54.444 --> 00:23:55.974
Zettai Karen Children!

00:23:55.974 --> 00:23:59.344
Episode 14: "Brilliant Minds?!
The Children Are Great Detectives!"

00:23:59.344 --> 00:24:00.814
Shiho's being cool today.

00:24:00.884 --> 00:24:03.684
Considering her dad's work, maybe
she'll grow up to be a cop.

00:24:03.684 --> 00:24:04.954
I'll catch this guy, I swear.

00:24:04.954 --> 00:24:05.484
Brilliant Minds!?
The Children Are Great Detectives!
I'll catch this guy, I swear.

00:24:05.484 --> 00:24:08.354
Brilliant Minds!?
The Children Are Great Detectives!
We're absolutely lovely, so we never lose!

00:24:08.354 --> 00:24:09.914
Brilliant Minds!?
The Children Are Great Detectives!
